    "name": "Reincarnation in Another World",
    "steam_appid": 3554750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you suddenly appear in a different world, and all kinds of unknown monsters appear before your eyes.\u00a0You have to find a way to return to the world that originally belonged to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Traditional barrage: You can improve your barrage shooting ability through a variety of weapons/equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Possess RPG-style skills: You will have multiple skills in the game, and you can use skills to perform various displacements, instant transfers, or increase damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 There are 5 difficulty and 30 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Multiple monsters: There are multiple monsters in each level, and the monsters have multiple different attack modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 There is a boss level: Only by defeating the boss can you pass the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Ability change: You can get different professions in the game. Choosing different professions can greatly change your attack coefficient and find the style that suits you best</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Talent system: Every time you complete a level, you will get points. Use points to improve your talents and make you stronger</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, you suddenly appear in a different world, and all kinds of unknown monsters appear before your eyes.\u00a0You have to find a way to return to the world that originally belonged to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Traditional barrage: You can improve your barrage shooting ability through a variety of weapons/equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Possess RPG-style skills: You will have multiple skills in the game, and you can use skills to perform various displacements, instant transfers, or increase damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 There are 5 difficulty and 30 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Multiple monsters: There are multiple monsters in each level, and the monsters have multiple different attack modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 There is a boss level: Only by defeating the boss can you pass the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Ability change: You can get different professions in the game. Choosing different professions can greatly change your attack coefficient and find the style that suits you best</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2727 Talent system: Every time you complete a level, you will get points. Use points to improve your talents and make you stronger</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Reincarnation in Another World&quot; is a roguelite game where you will have traditional barrage and different skills to fight against hordes of monsters. Choose from a variety of traits and power-ups to create a unique build and style to complete the game.",
